WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
(soft music)

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.890
- [Narrator] US officials
believe an explosion from a bomb

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.650
or some sort of sabotage
downed the private jet

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.060
carrying Wagner Group chief,

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.253
Yevgeny Prigozhin, on Wednesday,

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.343
though they cautioned

00:00:13.343 --> 00:00:15.813
assessments were
preliminary and incomplete.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.490
The Wall Street Journal
had three aviation experts

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.168
with combined decades of experience

00:00:22.168 --> 00:00:25.680
analyzing plane crashes
review the footage.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.420
Though they said it's hard to be certain

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.450
without access to physical
evidence at the crash site,

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.810
they too saw no signs that
the plane was shot down

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.850
and said initial evidence
suggests the crash

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:39.600
was probably caused by an
in-flight catastrophic failure,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.630
possibly due to a bomb or sabotage.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.533
Here's why.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.782
First, the plume of smoke around the plane

00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:51.267
seems to be the remnants
of an internal explosion.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:54.300
A missile strike would
create long tracks of smoke

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.070
from the missile's approach.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.513
None are seen here.

00:00:59.152 --> 00:01:03.030
Additionally, the jet,
an Embraer Legacy 600,

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.865
has no history of in-flight structural

00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:06.753
or mechanical failure.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.530
The plane also appears
mostly intact in its fall

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.453
with only one of the wings missing.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:17.610
A strike from a missile

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.890
capable of reaching more than 20,000 feet

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.520
would've broken the plane apart more.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:25.710
The white substance trailing
the plane is another clue

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.870
it was an internal explosion.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.570
It's not smoke, but
rather the plane's fuel,

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.780
spraying into the air
from ruptured fuel lines.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.570
A missile would've likely
ignited the leaking fuel,

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.133
resulting in black smoke.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:41.640
The way the plane falls

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:44.340
also points toward an internal explosion.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.800
It's fluttering to the
ground without control,

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.910
a possible indication

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.660
that the explosion happened
near the tail of the plane.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.990
The somewhat contained wreckage pattern

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:57.642
further supports an internal explosion.

00:01:57.642 --> 00:02:01.350
In one place, we can see
the main body of the plane,

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.563
while in another area a
mile away, we see the tail.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.990
A missile would've scattered shrapnel

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.493
and debris more widely.

00:02:10.053 --> 00:02:11.954
The leaking fuel appears to have ignited

00:02:11.954 --> 00:02:14.820
when the plane's main body crashed.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.980
Parts of the wreckage are
covered in small dents

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.810
according to the experts.

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.610
These are normal markings from impact

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.653
and probably not missile shrapnel.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.670
The markings are caused by
bolted sections tearing apart

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.290
and broken off pieces of the plane

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.153
hitting other parts of the aircraft.

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.600
All of this supports
preliminary assessments

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.100
from US intelligence,

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:38.253
which say Prigozhin was killed
in an assassination plot.

